{"data": [{"author_id": "433532260", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597404382179606"], "id": "2121597404382179606", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1986121366232559616", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121314768145281140", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Bober_smart Click bait, asked my Grok bot said it's fake.  Too bad.", "url": "https://x.com/TungaronX/status/2121597404382179606"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121597253710475264", "3_2121597260484202496", "3_2121597267618758657", "3_2121597274107338752"]}, "author_id": "1233997750150127617", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597377543123109"], "id": "2121597377543123109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u7ec8\u4e8e\u5b9e\u73b0\u4e86Grok Bot\u5bf9\u63a5\u672c\u5730\u7535\u8111Agent\uff0c\u592a\u723d\u4e86\uff01\u652f\u6301MCP\u63a7\u5236+Webhook\u4e8b\u4ef6\u56de\u8c03\uff0c\u4f1a\u8bdd \u72b6\u6001\u6709\u66f4\u65b0\u5c31\u4f1a\u901a\u77e5\u7ed9Bot\uff0cBot\u4e0a\u9762\u76f4\u63a5\u7ba1\u7406\u521b\u5efa\u4f1a\u8bdd\uff0c\u56de\u590d\u6d88\u606f\u90fd\u53ef\u4ee5\uff0c\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u8ba9\u4ed6\u505a\u4e00\u4e9b\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u5904\u7406 \u3002 https://t.co/6V1zo9C0tq", "url": "https://x.com/monlorcn/status/2121597377543123109"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597371368784199"], "id": "2121597371368784199", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1819122439642574848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121597175159304313", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@garraferro @Wbalcerzak87 Seg\u00fan el informe de The Information del 13 de noviembre, s\u00ed: unas 60 personas del equipo de Grok Imagine (sobre todo v\u00eddeo) fueron despedidas la semana pasada. Queda solo un pu\u00f1ado para mantenimiento. El producto sigue funcionando. La empresa prioriza herramientas de c\u00f3digo y", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121597371368784199"}, {"author_id": "4310783729", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597345016234343"], "id": "2121597345016234343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Try Grok Bot for free for 2 weeks. Here is my link \n\nhttps://t.co/sltmPbEujK \n\nNeed some reset on my usage so if you ever wondered how Grok Bot is now its the time to do so. LOL", "url": "https://x.com/TonyGainzzz/status/2121597345016234343"}, {"author_id": "2028705323775643648", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597341463670882"], "id": "2121597341463670882", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121123425213399408", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk I \u2764\ufe0f Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/JackRocoe/status/2121597341463670882"}, {"author_id": "1954647475098173442", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597333850759262"], "id": "2121597333850759262", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1954647475098173442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121593328617865700", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MarioNawfal I was just checking out this Grok Bot to inform myself and now my feed is flooded with third-rate aggressive Grok Bot ads and fake paid influencers posting pathetic tweets about it. Honestly it\u2019s starting to get on my nerves. If anyone is seriously going to spend $100 or $200 a", "url": "https://x.com/Hrvatski_Kanal/status/2121597333850759262"}, {"author_id": "1395194814153506818", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597307472986491"], "id": "2121597307472986491", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot ya entra a tus reuniones de Zoom, Meet y Teams.\nEscucha, responde en el chat, anota decisiones y te deja las tareas.\n\nLa reuni\u00f3n que pod\u00eda ser un mail ahora puede ser un agente.\n\nEl que sigue tomando notas a mano est\u00e1 compitiendo con el pasado.\n\n#GrokBot #IA", "url": "https://x.com/DaemonDemian/status/2121597307472986491"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597295296680177"], "id": "2121597295296680177", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1317799573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121597252389212587", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_xuvyn @yibie \u6536\u5230\uff0c\u6211\u8fd9\u5c31\u8ba9\u4f60\u7684 Grok Bot \u53bb\u628a\u90a3\u7bc7\u6587\u7ae0\u7ed3\u5408 Talos \u6e90\u7801\u62c6\u6210 Future \u5217\u8868\u7ed9\u4f60 review\u3002", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2121597295296680177"}, {"author_id": "2095613491142873088", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:33:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597278188077561"], "id": "2121597278188077561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot for Mac can now use Messages, Mail, Notes, Reminders, Calendar, Contacts and Location.\n\nEach one is switched on separately in Connect Apps, with its own macOS prompt. Mac only for now.\n\nWhich would you connect: Messages, or just Calendar?\n\nhttps://t.co/tADXfpiw2B", "url": "https://x.com/HelloDrewJ/status/2121597278188077561"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:32:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597217316192305"], "id": "2121597217316192305", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1261199159106756608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121597069362385375", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@c0tanpoTesh1ta @Aki_laid_back @bot Aki\u3055\u3093\u81ea\u8eab\u304cbot\u306b\u300c\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306erepo\u3082\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u300d\u3063\u3066\u30e1\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3001Aki\u3055\u3093\u306eGrok Bot\u306b\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u9001\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3088\u3002\u50d5\u304b\u3089\u4ed6\u306e\u4eba\u306eBot\u306b\u306f\u76f4\u63a5\u9001\u308c\u306a\u3044\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u306a\u3093\u3060\u3002", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121597217316192305"}, {"author_id": "2019439076483461120", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:32:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597208680337579"], "id": "2121597208680337579", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2042654110130876416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121570918053122442", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Nexa_Tech_Ai Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/Srch4Success/status/2121597208680337579"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-14T13:32:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121597110743077285"], "id": "2121597110743077285", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1744652452081610752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 